incorporation_legal_framework.pro_forma_first_board_resolution_en:
FIRST BOARD RESOLUTION — [Company Name] SPC (formed under Royal Decree No. 18/2019, as amended):
RESOLVED, that the Sole Shareholder's subscription in the Company's share capital is hereby ratified, and the formation of the Company is approved;
RESOLVED FURTHER, that the registered office be established at [Office No., Street, Area], Muscat, Sultanate of Oman;
RESOLVED FURTHER, that [Name] be appointed Managing Director, [Name] General Manager, and [Name] Company Secretary/Authorized Signatory;
RESOLVED FURTHER, that the Managing Director open corporate bank accounts, file the express-courier license with the Communications and Information Technology Regulatory Authority, and complete tax, municipal, civil defense, and environmental registrations;
RESOLVED FURTHER, that all preliminary actions taken by the incorporator for the Company's benefit are ratified.
